{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45682","headline":"送颢雅禅师 · 贯休","name":"送颢雅禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜锋擗石鸟雀聚，帆冻阴飙吹不举。\n芬陀利香释驎虎，幡幢冒雪争迎取。\n春光主，芙蓉堂窄堆花乳，手提金桴打金鼓。\n天花娉婷下如雨，狻猊座上师子语。\n苦却乐，乐却苦，卢至黄金忽如土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}